<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ferro started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ferro started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Ferro Corp with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 29-3/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst said 12-month price target is $38 per share, and the 1997 earnings outlook is $2.15 per share and for 1998 it is $2.55 per share.</p>
</text>
